<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ColourFastness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Observed performance parameter describing the resistance of a textile colour to fading, running or alteration under conditions such as washing, rubbing, perspiration or light exposure."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ColourFastness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ColourFastness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Colour fastness"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ColourFastness> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#evidenceStatus> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#explicitEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ColourFastness> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "Colour fastness is the resistance parameter; colour fading is a typical visual failure expression of its degradation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ColourFastness> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "Observed colour fastness contributes to the interpretation of intrinsic durability, while colour fading is a failure expression."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ColourFastness> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "JRC Annex 13.10.1, printed page 468, lines 11065-11071; Annex 13.4, Table 124, printed pages 362-367 where applicable."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ColourFastness> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#adaptedDefinition> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ColourFastness> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#typicalFailureExpression> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ColourFading> .
