<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#DimensionalStability> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://susproc.jrc.ec.europa.eu/product-bureau/sites/default/files/2025-12/Textile-Prep-Study_3rd-Milestone_20251212.pdf> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#DimensionalStability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Observed performance parameter describing the ability of a textile product or fabric to retain its dimensions after use, laundering or other treatment cycles."@en .
