<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#DimensionalStability> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "Dimensional stability contributes to the interpretation of intrinsic durability; loss of dimensional stability is the corresponding failure expression."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#DimensionalStability> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "Dimensional stability is the performance parameter; loss of dimensional stability is the corresponding failure expression."@en .
