<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Durability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ability of a product to maintain over time its function and performance under specified conditions of use, maintenance and repair."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Durability> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> .
