<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Durability> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#evidenceStatus> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#explicitEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Durability> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "Through the alignment txtdur:Durability rdfs:subClassOf dpp:Durability, this class inherits dpp:QualityIndicator and dpp:QuantitativeProperty. This is an inherited EU DPP Core commitment: it does not make a durability instance a numeric value. Numerical observations and results remain represented through Textile Assessment and txtcon:QuantitativeValue."@en .
