<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ElasticityLoss> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "CIRPASS Textile Ontology modelling specification, version 1.1.0."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ElasticityLoss> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingAbstraction> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ElasticityLoss> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#typicallyIncreasesLikelihoodOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#LossOfComfort> .
