# https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#FabricSmoothness
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#FabricSmoothness> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#FabricSmoothness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#SurfacePerformanceParameter> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#FabricSmoothness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#VisualPerformanceParameter> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#FabricSmoothness> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#FabricSmoothness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Observed performance parameter describing the visible or tactile smoothness of a fabric surface, commonly considered during visual inspection after washing, drying or other durability-related stress."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#FabricSmoothness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> .
