<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#FabricSmoothness> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Surface smoothness"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#FabricSmoothness> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#evidenceStatus> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#explicitEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#FabricSmoothness> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "Fabric smoothness is represented as an observed performance parameter. A measured value or inspection grade should be represented in the assessment module, while rough or stiff fabric is modelled as a failure expression."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#FabricSmoothness> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "CIRPASS Textile Ontology modelling specification, version 1.1.0."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#FabricSmoothness> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingAbstraction> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#FabricSmoothness> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#typicalFailureExpression> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#RoughOrStiffFabric> .
