<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#FunctionalFailureMode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Category of failure modes primarily involving loss of intended use, comfort or functional suitability of a textile product."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#FunctionalFailureMode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> .
