<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#FunctionalFailureMode> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "Introduced to represent failure modes that are not adequately captured by visual, structural, mechanical or component failure categories alone."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#FunctionalFailureMode> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "CIRPASS Textile Ontology modelling specification, version 1.1.0."@en .
