<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ObservedPerformanceParameter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#Property> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ObservedPerformanceParameter> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ObservedPerformanceParameter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Durability-related product characteristic that can be observed, assessed or measured to evaluate physical durability. It denotes the characteristic type, not a test, observation, result or quantitative value."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ObservedPerformanceParameter> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> .
