# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Pilling
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Pilling> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Pilling> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#ObservedDegradationPhenomenon> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Pilling> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#SurfaceDegradationPhenomenon> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Pilling> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://susproc.jrc.ec.europa.eu/product-bureau/sites/default/files/2025-12/Textile-Prep-Study_3rd-Milestone_20251212.pdf> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Pilling> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Observed surface degradation phenomenon involving the formation of small balls or pills of entangled fibres on a textile surface during wear, friction, use or testing."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Pilling> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Pilling> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Pilling"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Pilling> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#evidenceStatus> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#explicitEvidence> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Pilling> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "Observed pilling may contribute to fabric breakdown as part of a progressive surface degradation process, but it should not be treated as the sole necessary cause of fabric breakdown."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Pilling> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "Observed pilling negatively affects the interpretation of intrinsic durability; pilling resistance, if modelled separately, should be represented as a protective characteristic."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Pilling> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "JRC Annex 13.10.1, printed page 468, lines 11065-11071; Annex 13.4, Table 124, printed pages 362-367 where applicable."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Pilling> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#adaptedDefinition> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#Pilling> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#typicalProgressionTo> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#FabricBreakdown> .
