<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability#PillingResistance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Durability-related performance characteristic describing the ability of a textile material, fabric or product to resist the formation of pills under friction, wear or use conditions."@en .
